        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nIt is unknown who made it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nIt is unknown who made it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flûte produisant des sons qui semblent\nprovenir d’un autre monde. On ne sait\npas qui l’a fabriquée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nIt is unknown who made it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nIt is unknown who made it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "このよの　ものとは　おもえない\nねいろが　なりひびく　ふえ。　いつ\nだれが　つくったのか　わからない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "이 세상의 것이라고는 생각할 수 없는\n음색이 울려 퍼지는 피리. 언제\n누가 만들었는지 모른다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une flûte produisant des sons qui semblent\nprovenir d’un autre monde. On ne sait pas qui\nl’a fabriquée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Flöte, deren Töne nicht von dieser Welt zu\nsein scheinen. Ihr Erschaffer ist nicht bekannt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Campana de aspecto antiguo que emite un sonido\nque calma el espíritu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Flauto che emette una melodia che sembra\nappartenere a un altro mondo. Non si sa\nchi l’abbia creato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A flute that puts out echoing sounds\nthat do not seem to be of this world.\nNo one knows who made it.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "この世の　ものとは　おもえない\n音色が　なりひびく　ふえ。　いつ\nだれが　つくったのか　わからない。",
